sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Reins Panel
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant DB as Event Store
    participant A as Pi Worker
    U->>UI: Steer selected execution
    UI->>C: commandId + target + text
    C->>DB: Commit directive.accepted
    C-->>UI: Receipt: queued
    A->>C: Prepare next model request
    C->>DB: Snapshot + budget reservation + effect.admitted
    C-->>A: Request permit + directive IDs
    A->>C: Dispatch observation
    C->>DB: Commit directive.dispatched
    C-->>UI: Delivered to request, not compliance
    A->>C: Result / artifact submission
    C->>DB: Version + snapshot lineage
    C-->>UI: Artifact with applied-input lineage
